                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I liked that XOXO Droplets tied into the game Our Life, but it definitely wasn't anywhere near as good.\n\nThe biggest problem was the characters. Most of the guys were rude, obnoxious, or just plain cringy, and I didn't really like the MC either. I know the whole point was that these weren't exactly dream boyfriends, but I still needed [i]something[/i] that made me understand why she was throwing herself at them so hard. \nMost of the time, I just didn't see it.\n\nI originally wanted to finish at least one route with every guy, but once I realized I could use old saves to knock out the rest pretty quickly, I did that instead. There were only a couple endings that even felt remotely worth all the pining.\n\nOverall, it felt pretty uninspired and boring, with sprinkles of cringe mixed in.",
